{{!--
Replaces Ghost's own call to action under a post or page the reader may not read in full (members-only,
paid or tiers visibility). Ghost's {{content}} helper renders this partial instead of the text, with the
post as its context: {{{html}}} is the public preview (the part above the « public preview » divider of
the editor), then this box. Texts come from the theme's locales; colours and buttons from the design
system (src/css/article/features.css). « S'abonner » leads to the theme's subscription page
(subscribe-link.hbs) for a members-only post; for a paid one, to Ghost's Portal, which shows the plans.
« Se connecter » leads to the sign-in form of that page (signin-link.hbs). A member without access (paid
content) gets « Changer d'abonnement » (Portal).
--}}
{{{html}}}
<aside class="members-cta" aria-labelledby="members-cta-title" data-members-cta>
  <h2 class="members-cta__title js-toc-ignore" id="members-cta-title">
    {{> "icons/lock"}}
    <span>
    {{#has visibility="paid"}}
      {{#is "page"}}{{t "This page is for paying subscribers only"}}{{else}}{{t "This post is for paying subscribers only"}}{{/is}}
    {{/has}}
    {{#has visibility="members"}}
      {{#is "page"}}{{t "This page is for subscribers only"}}{{else}}{{t "This post is for subscribers only"}}{{/is}}
    {{/has}}
    {{#has visibility="tiers"}}
      {{#is "page"}}
        {{t "This page is reserved for these plans: {tiers}" tiers=(tiers separator=", " lastSeparator=(t " and ") suffix="")}}
      {{else}}
        {{t "This post is reserved for these plans: {tiers}" tiers=(tiers separator=", " lastSeparator=(t " and ") suffix="")}}
      {{/is}}
    {{/has}}
    </span>
  </h2>
  <p class="members-cta__actions">
    {{#if @member}}
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#/portal/account/plans" data-portal="account/plans">{{t "Upgrade your account"}}</a>
    {{else}}
      {{#has visibility="members"}}
        {{> subscribe-link class="button button--primary" label=(t "Subscribe")}}
      {{else}}
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup">{{t "Subscribe"}}</a>
      {{/has}}
      {{#if @site.members_enabled}}
        <span class="members-cta__signin">{{t "Already a member?"}} {{> signin-link class="members-cta__login"}}</span>
      {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
  </p>
</aside>
